      "body": "\nProduct Link:  \nhttps://DreamOmni2.com\n\nDescription  \nDreamOmni2 is an innovative AI-powered virtual character platform, designed to provide users with personalized virtual character customization, supporting multilingual interaction.\n\nHighlights:\n- **Multilingual Support**: The platform supports major global languages, enabling smooth interaction with virtual characters.\n- **Personalized Customization**: Users can customize their virtual character's appearance, personality, and voice according to their needs.\n- **Highly Interactive**: The AI system adjusts the virtual character's responses in real-time based on the user's behavior and emotions.\n\nProject：https://pbihao.github.io/projects/DreamOmni2/index.html\nDemo：https://huggingface.co/spaces/wcy1122/DreamOmni2-Edit\nCode：https://github.com/dvlab-research/DreamOmni2",
